      "writtenOn": "2026-04-03T00:55:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This patch is only needed after we have the usage of kicking a guest vcpu. When we add the patch \"pKVM: x86: Add pkvm_vcpu_enter_guest()\", there is no code to kick a guest vCPU so seems we don\u0027t need this patch as a fix? Until we have the patch \"pKVM: VMX: Implement TLB flush for guest EPT\" which needs to kick guest vCPUs, this patch is needed. So maybe this patch should be re-ordered and applied right before or after \"pKVM: VMX: Implement TLB flush for guest EPT\"?",
